{"steam_appid":1721110,"steam_name":"Abyssus","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1721110/2084464374/77810c862509097ec8c91764687eb5ce9a8d4134/1781862285/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1782398792","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257362286/b527fb4e5310e46c162590ab6ce772f4dfdaac6a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1782398792","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/d67c0ddedba9543d8b8b5b420d204b24b2d90a1d/ss_d67c0ddedba9543d8b8b5b420d204b24b2d90a1d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782399113","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/619eb1fc188088a2cae0120b9d292137cfdcbbcf/ss_619eb1fc188088a2cae0120b9d292137cfdcbbcf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782399113","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/8feffdb6292b71f275ae6092f3c332d339505de4/ss_8feffdb6292b71f275ae6092f3c332d339505de4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782399113","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/d9a92b97db1159ebc48a0bcf0954708f7ee15db1/ss_d9a92b97db1159ebc48a0bcf0954708f7ee15db1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782399113","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/08c95f2c703a849eb893c6276901eab4dc6d31a8/ss_08c95f2c703a849eb893c6276901eab4dc6d31a8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782399113"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/abf27cca90a2643eb6248e1fb17d605f.avif?t=1782399113\" width=616 height=478 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gather your friends and dive into <i>Abyssus</i>' fast-paced multiplayer shooting action. Fight through gorgeous hand-crafted levels in a roguelite adventure that will put your tactical skills to the ultimate test. Wield powerful brine-powered weapons and refit them with ancient technologies to gain an edge over your foes. Obtain divine blessings to enhance your firepower with elemental and mystic effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In a world powered by brine, a rare and powerful substance only found in the deepest fathoms of the sea, your team of daring brinepunk explorers is recruited to claim a massive deposit located beneath the ruins of an ancient civilization. However, your mission becomes a frantic battle for survival when the sunken kingdom’s corrupted inhabitants rise against you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Will you survive to see the surface again, or will the abyss claim your life?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/060495c0dd29b94e090c7123f38ef578.poster.avif?t=1782399113\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/060495c0dd29b94e090c7123f38ef578.webm?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/060495c0dd29b94e090c7123f38ef578.mp4?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/a1ad5e5635d7dfd0903f849cf5e9343c.poster.avif?t=1782399113\" width=616 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/a1ad5e5635d7dfd0903f849cf5e9343c.webm?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/a1ad5e5635d7dfd0903f849cf5e9343c.mp4?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <i>Abyssus</i>, cooperation means survival. Team up with fellow <strong>Brinehunters</strong> and carefully choose synergic loadouts, skills, suits, and weapon mods. Work together and fight through a merciless roguelite gauntlet, where no run is the same as the last. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/abf8fcfa85af4a7ad4d5d3567e41a22b.poster.avif?t=1782399113\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/abf8fcfa85af4a7ad4d5d3567e41a22b.webm?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/abf8fcfa85af4a7ad4d5d3567e41a22b.mp4?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/1742315b7696db8792df1da173aa26b5.poster.avif?t=1782399113\" width=616 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/1742315b7696db8792df1da173aa26b5.webm?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/1742315b7696db8792df1da173aa26b5.mp4?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Wield highly customizable, brine-powered armaments and infuse them with the might of ancient Gods. Master 8 weapons and 45 weapon mods, upgrading your skills and suit as you face the underwater kingdom’s mutated guardians. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/624ce8f16666993a4b5671a418c289fc.poster.avif?t=1782399113\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/624ce8f16666993a4b5671a418c289fc.webm?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/624ce8f16666993a4b5671a418c289fc.mp4?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/74d53b4dc03a7c262d76f02174f2dcc4.poster.avif?t=1782399113\" width=616 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/74d53b4dc03a7c262d76f02174f2dcc4.webm?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/74d53b4dc03a7c262d76f02174f2dcc4.mp4?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Run after run, you’ll access more and more upgrades and tactical choices, but firepower alone won’t save you from the denizens of the depths. Mastering <i>Abyssus</i>'s visceral gunplay and fast-paced action will require tactical coordination, positioning skills, and cohesive teamwork. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/46e14dc13ca2bf254a855264393fe8c5.poster.avif?t=1782399113\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/46e14dc13ca2bf254a855264393fe8c5.webm?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/46e14dc13ca2bf254a855264393fe8c5.mp4?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/46c1f1c163df3e4c010aa6fe50e0646b.poster.avif?t=1782399113\" width=616 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/46c1f1c163df3e4c010aa6fe50e0646b.webm?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/46c1f1c163df3e4c010aa6fe50e0646b.mp4?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The world of <i>Abyssus</i> is richly atmospheric and steeped in mystery. What untold secrets lie in the sunken kingdom? What gives brine its inexplicable powers? Can we weaponize an anglerfish? The answers lie deep down below… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/39c2089ed93de4bb29916481e8b46901.poster.avif?t=1782399113\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/39c2089ed93de4bb29916481e8b46901.webm?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/39c2089ed93de4bb29916481e8b46901.mp4?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/3fdfc07c02577446b8ab85c14b6ac96a.poster.avif?t=1782399113\" width=616 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/3fdfc07c02577446b8ab85c14b6ac96a.webm?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/3fdfc07c02577446b8ab85c14b6ac96a.mp4?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visceral, fast-paced FPS action, with top-notch weapon feel and combat responsiveness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4-players co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite meta progression with advancements, rewards, and unlocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70+ hand-crafted levels, procedurally sequenced to make every run a new experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 different weapons customizable with 45 weapon mods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 140 Ancient Forge mods to further empower weapons and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive pre-run and in-run character customization options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >36 different enemies and 12 bosses that will put your skills to the challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 250 Charms and Blessings to craft the perfect build</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/b4c7644edec06d031c232b40657f68f0.poster.avif?t=1782399113\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/b4c7644edec06d031c232b40657f68f0.webm?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/b4c7644edec06d031c232b40657f68f0.mp4?t=1782399113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700K or AMD Ryzen 5 1600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti, 2GB or AMD Radeon R7 360, 2GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Low 1080p @ 30 FPS</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-11700K or AMD Ryzen 7 3700X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 SUPER, 4GB or AMD Radeon RX 5600, 6GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> High 1080p @ 60 FPS</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["DoubleMoose Games"],"publishers":["The Arcade Crew","Dotemu"],"release_date":"12 Aug, 2025"}